  "reasoning": "The question has two parts. (1) When does the umpire show a red card? This is answered by itto-5.17.4 (the umpire raises a red card when faulting a side under Law 16.7.1.2 or 16.7.1.3), laws-16.7.1.2 (faulting if previously warned), laws-16.7.1.3 (faulting in cases of flagrant offence or breach), and itto-3.6.2 (flagrant or other misbehaviour resulting in a red card). (2) What happens next? This is answered by itto-5.17.4 (the umpire must call the Referee on court and report immediately) and laws-16.7.2 (the umpire reports to the Referee, who may disqualify the offending side). No part is missing.",
